  "notes": "Original run theme of the waves mode (it plays only in that mode's run, never in the classic run): a marching arena groove in D minor at 150 BPM. A short build-up plays once (a D pedal with the drums coming in), then the loop: a verse over D minor - B flat - C - A, played twice (the second time it rises and closes on A with a drum fill), and a bridge over G minor - D minor - B flat - C that climbs to a high D and falls back through a second fill. Same instrument style and volumes as the other songs (melody on square1 at volume 3, harmony arpeggios on square2 at 2, a pumping octave bass on the wave channel at 1 with a half-height waveform, drums at 2), so every hit and miss is heard over it. The last wave switches to the boss theme (mus_boss) when the boss comes.",
